<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1. The unaudited standalone financial results(SFS) have been reviewed and recommended by the Audit Committee at its meeting held on Aug 12,24. The BOD at its meeting held on Aug 12, 24 have approved the above results and taken them on record.2.The statutory auditors of the Company (Co.) have expressed an unmodified opinion on the SFS for the quarter ended Jun 30, 24.3. The unaudited SFS of the Co have been prepared in accordance with Indian Accounting Standards (IndAS) notified under Sec 133 of The Companies Act, 2013 (the Act) read with the Companies (Indian Accounting Standard Rules), 2015 and in terms of Reg 33 of SEBI (LODR) Reg 2015.4. During the year ended Mar 31,24, the Company has completed its IPO of 15196510 equity shares of face value of Rs 10 each comprising of i.fresh issue of 43,67,088 equity shares at an issue price of Rs 790 per Equity Share ii. fresh issue of 69930 equity shares at an issue price of Rs 715 per equity share for employee quota iii. an offer for sale of 10759492 equity shares at an issue price of Rs 790 per equity share.The equity shares of the Company were listed on BSE and NSE on Dec 20, 23.   Details of the utilisation of IPO net proceeds is summarised below   Particulars     Amt(Rs lakhs)         (asper offer document)   Gross Proceeds from the issue    35000.00    (-) Estimated Issue related exps    (proportionate to Company's share)*   1842.50    Net Proceeds     33157.50   *Issue related exps (net of GST) amounting to Rs 1533.09 lakhs have been adjusted against securities premium as per Sec 52 of the Act   Details of the utilisation of IPO net proceeds is summarised below   Particulars Objects of the issue       Utilised upto Jun 30, 24   Unutilised as on Jun 30, 24   (as per offer    document)           Part financing of         28000.00    4314.44   23685.56    proposed project                  General Corporate       5157.50  5112.58    44.92    Purposes   Total utilisation of       33157.50  9427.02   23730.48   funds   Out of the Net proceeds which were unutilised as at Jun 30, 24, Rs 22500.00 lakhs are temporarily invested in FD, Rs 1059.36 lakhs (including 20.36 lakhs interest receipt on FD) is held in the Co's Monitoring Account, while the balance amount is held in the public offer account towards the Co's share of exps related to Issue.5. During the qtr ended Jun 30, 24, the Company acquired 51% stake in SKIDO Industries Pvt Ltd (SKIDO) for consideration aggregating to Rs 51.00 lakhs. The shares of SKIDO were allotted to the Co. on Apr 01, 24 effective which SKIDO became subsidiary of the Company from that date.   6. The Equity Shares and basic/diluted earnings per share for comparative period (qtr ended Jun 30, 23) has been presented considering the adjustments for issue of bonus shares as approved by shareholders on July 03, 23 in accordance with Ind AS 33-Earnings per share.7. The figures for the qtr ended Mar 31, 24 are the balancing figures between audited figures in respect of the full F.Y. and the published year to date figures upto nine months ended Dec 31, 23. Also the figures upto the end of the third qtr had only been reviewed and not subjected to audit. Attention is drawn to the fact that the figures for the corresponding qtr ended Jun 30, 23 as reported in these SFS have been approved by the Co's BOD but have not been subjected to review since the requirement of submission of quarterly SFS is applicable on listing of Equity Shares of the Company, which was from the qtr ended Dec 31, 23.8.The results for the qtr ended Jun 30, 24 are available on the Co's website at www.domsindia.com and also on the website of BSE at www.bseindia.com and NSE at www.nseindia.com, where the shares of the Co are listed.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
